WEBVTT

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:04.150
Geez...

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:07.580
How did we end up coming
to an insane place like this?!

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:12.690
Quit complaining! Real men
don't cling to the past!

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:15.390
You idiot! Whose fault do you think this is?!

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.360
If you hadn't exaggerated so much
we'd be closer to the capital now!

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:23.930
You're too uptight, Taito. You'll never
be popular with the girls like that!

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:25.400
Right, Laila?

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.670
Whatever, just hurry ahead!

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.430
Yes, yes! Sure thing!

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:42.620
H-Hosei... How much further is it?

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:47.220
Hmm, maybe about an
hour more if we're lucky?

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:51.060
No! I wanna go back!

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:55.300
You sound so cute
when you're crying too, Laila!

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.960
This is no time for that!

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:01.520
A shortcut to the capital?!

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:08.000
Yep! I'm from these parts, so I know
<i>all</i> the secret paths and shortcuts!

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.580
It'll be ten days quicker
than going the normal way!

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:12.780
Really?! That much?!

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:14.400
Every single morning you say,

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:17.840
"I wanna get to the capital,
I wanna get to the capital!"

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:21.040
I've started to feel bad for you!

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:26.620
Well, Laila? Have you
changed your opinion of me?!

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:28.860
Not really.

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:31.720
That cold look is irresistable too!

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:36.640
All right, Hosei! Let's just
take this shortcut of yours!

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:38.100
I need to hurry to the capital

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.240
so I can kick the crap
out of that mustached bastard!

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:42.960
Right! Just leave it to me!

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:53.120
What the hell?! Your so-called
shortcut was a lie,

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.780
and we're just heading back to your master?!

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:57.540
What a load of crap!

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:03.660
It's not my fault! You wouldn't
have come if I had told the truth!

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:07.560
And then who knows when
I would ever see Laila again!

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.320
Hell if I care!

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:11.260
Don't be so reproachful, Taito.

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:13.240
Given that he's obtained
the Shuang Chan Bow,

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:15.760
he's duty-bound to report to his master.

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:19.300
So?! Why do <i>we</i> have to
come along with him?!

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.180
Hey, Hosei.

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:26.980
You told us before, but your
master is really scary, right?

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:31.480
Yeah... She's not human.
She's a monster!

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:35.120
Stop, Hosei! Don't speak
of your master that way!

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:39.120
Easy for you to say!
You don't know her!

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:43.260
She's one seriously dangerous hag!

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:45.660
If she had found out
I got my hands on this

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:48.840
and went to the capital
without letting her know...

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:56.720
Hosei! I told you to return
as soon as you obtained the bow!

00:02:56.720 --> 00:03:00.540
I-I'm sorry, Master!

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:04.980
Absolutely unforgivable!

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:10.220
...is probably what'd happen.

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:12.220
Don't be silly...!

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:14.960
She's a legendary hag
in many other ways too!

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.360
Cracks open in the ground
when she stomps her feet!

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:20.000
Birds fall from the sky when she shouts!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.200
She chops daikon radishes
with her bare hands!

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.640
She drinks a full bottle every night!

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.140
She wears heavy makeup!

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:27.680
She snores like crazy!

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:30.480
They got kind of lame at the end there...

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.140
But she really is serious trouble!

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:35.080
Oh! What should I do?!

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:38.920
I wish I could just run off
with you right now, Laila!

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:42.180
But if she found me she'd kill me!

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.720
Don't go holding Laila's hand!

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:47.260
Oh, come on, dumb brother!

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:49.560
Don't call me your brother!

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:52.160
Then I'll just call you dumb!

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.100
What?!

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:56.600
Who's the dumb one?! Who's the
dumb one?! Who's the dumb one?!

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.840
Why did you say it three times today?

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.700
We finally made it...

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:12.780
I don't wanna do this,
but it <i>is</i> my duty as her pupil...

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:17.300
You should check out the hag, too,
to give us something to talk about later.

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:19.920
Assuming I survive, that is.

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:25.900
I-If Hosei has to put it like that,
maybe she really is like a demon...

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:26.960
Yeah, right!

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:29.200
Master! I'm back!

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.580
Welcome back, Hosei!

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.400
I'm so glad you're back!
You must be exhausted!

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:37.820
Are you hurt at all?
Have you grown a little?

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:41.320
I'll make your favorite dinner
tonight! Green pepper steak!

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:43.420
Stop, Master! Stop!

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.920
Don't be silly!

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:49.120
My adorable pupil is finally back
after a long, arduous journey!

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.400
It's natural to be this ecstatic!

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:53.660
We have guests! Guests!

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.920
Guests?

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:57.420
Oh, my!

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:01.000
Welcome!

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:04.780
<i>This</i> is Hosei's master?

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:08.240
--This is...
--...hard to believe...

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:11.840
It's nice to meet you! I'm Koei!

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:15.240
You're Taito and Laila
from Lian Tong Temple,

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:18.180
and Ryuko from Tong You Temple, yes?

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:20.480
How do you know who we are?

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:25.420
I heard about Master Sonnei
summoning Ryuko to Lian Tong Temple

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:30.260
and the three of you setting out on a journey.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.840
Considering the karma of the stars,
it was very possible

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:35.040
that you would come across my little Hosei.

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:37.040
Oh...

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:41.280
Lady Koei, it's no wonder you're known
as "Yiyang's fount of knowledge."

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.700
You have my admiration.

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:47.220
Oh, you! Don't flatter me like that!

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:48.840
Say, Hosei!

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:53.780
I hope you didn't say anything
to give them the wrong idea about me!

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:57.360
I-I've told them nothing but the truth.

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:00.160
Like about how you're a tough old hag!

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.700
What?!

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:06.040
How can you possibly call such
a young and beautiful maiden a hag?!

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:09.500
What're you talking about?
You turn 39 this year!

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:11.200
Not so loud!

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:14.180
Whatever! You have to <i>paint</i>
your makeup on to look young!

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:20.020
What?! You should watch what you say,
you pants-wetting little brat!

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.640
Aha! You show your true colors!

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:25.880
Your makeup is so heavy
that your disguise peels right off!

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:28.560
How dare you! Get back here!

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:30.660
They're less like master and pupil...

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:33.640
...and more like friends who like to quarrel...

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:41.600
Honestly, now! It took you
long enough to find one simple bow!

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:45.240
Shut up! You could've
given me some clues, but <i>no</i>...!

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:48.340
I can't hear you!

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:53.880
Wait, you knew where the bow was, Koei?

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:57.760
I can't hear you either!

00:06:57.760 --> 00:06:59.180
She's spent years in these mountains

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:02.360
storing away every bit of
information that comes her way.

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:05.060
There's nothing she doesn't know!

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:10.560
But there'd be no fun in telling you to go
get the bow from such-and-such place!

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:13.440
Don't give your pupils pointless
hard work just because it's fun!

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:16.580
I can't hear you!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.540
But it's certainly a surprise to learn

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:22.740
that Lady Koei, the fount
of knowledge, is like this.

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:28.040
Ryuko. What exactly do you mean
when you say "like this"?

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:33.760
Oh, uhh, there is no deep meaning to it.
Please excuse my rudeness.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:39.220
But it's hard to believe you're really
the legendary Dipper Bearers,

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.220
seeing you like this...

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:44.900
Yeah! Even I don't know what to think!

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.460
Being suddenly told
you're an Alkaid or whatever

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:50.680
and a bunch of stuff
about the karma of the stars...

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:54.300
All I wanna do is kick the crap
out of that mustached bastard!

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:55.780
Mustached bastard?

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:59.940
The Dubhe. General Keiro of the Xian Empire.

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.120
I see.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:06.960
Whether we want it to be or not,
the karma of the stars is always at work...

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.160
And even being pushed
around by it is karma...

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:16.300
Setting aside Hosei's Phecda,
Mizar is a nerve-wracked star.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.160
Y-yes...

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:21.440
But I'm not sure you can stand up to Keiro

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:24.500
seeing as you can't fully
use Energy Manipulation.

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:28.380
You can tell?

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:32.140
Yes. The waves put off by people
who can manipulate energy

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:34.340
look different from those who can't.

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:37.680
There it is! The insight of an old hag!

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:41.360
Taito! It was some sort of
fate that brought you here!

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:45.400
If you'd like, I can teach you
the basics of Energy Manipulation!

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.120
Huh?! Really?!

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:49.020
That's great, Taito!

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:53.040
My master has a terrible
personality but is great at teaching!

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:56.300
You could've left out the personality part.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:59.980
Taito. It's a very generous offer. Accept it.

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:05.040
Learning it won't let you suddenly
beat Keiro or anything, though.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:07.480
Please teach me, Koei!

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.420
Okay, then!

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:13.880
We'll start in the evening,
so use this time to recharge yourself!

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:26.260
These are pretty flowers.

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:30.440
Yes. They're moth orchids.

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:31.680
Moth orchids...

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:34.780
Here you are, Your Majesty.

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:36.540
Shokaku...

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:40.280
General Keiro has returned.
Please see him.

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:43.380
What of the rebellion?

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:46.780
He crushed it, precisely as you ordered.

00:09:46.780 --> 00:09:48.960
As I ordered...

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:52.060
Please come and greet him as well, Lady Taki.

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:54.600
This is a proud moment for your father.

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:56.080
Yes...

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:07.800
They're certainly close to each other.

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:10.420
The emperor of the Xian Empire on one hand

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:12.740
and the daughter of the general on the other.

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:14.640
They strike a good balance.

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:20.880
I'm sure you worked quite hard
for that balance to be struck, Lady Choka.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:28.500
Okay, let's begin.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:30.480
Yeah! Let's do it!

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:37.400
Act gung-ho while you still can, Taito!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:40.780
First, try gathering energy
the way you normally do.

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:42.740
Stay calm and relax.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:43.940
Right.

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:51.120
Oops!

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:54.980
No good. He still can't control it.

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:58.860
Ooh, you're in for a beating now!

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:03.200
Try again.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:18.980
Looks like it's inner-channel after all.

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:20.600
Okay, this time...

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:24.120
...try concentrating your energy like this.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.120
Lady Koei! He mustn't!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:30.700
Concentrating energy while empty-handed
will be too much for his body to bear!

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:32.620
Just watch.

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:35.860
Make sure not to break the armband.

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:37.800
O-okay.

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:50.220
Don't rush. Energy Manipulation
isn't about strength.

00:11:50.220 --> 00:11:53.040
Close your eyes, relax your breathing,

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:56.240
and think of your arm as a flexible tube.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:58.880
Flexible... tube...

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:09.880
Here I come, Taito!

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:24.280
You did it! Take a look at your arm!

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:27.040
K-Koei...!

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:29.720
I punched as hard as I could, too...

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:32.560
It's because you punched with
energy instead of brute strength.

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.880
It had no effect on your body as a result.

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:37.100
How is this possible, Lady Koei?!

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:42.620
It's simple. Taito has inner-channel
Energy Manipulation, that's all.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:44.540
Inner-channel?

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:48.800
Is this "inner-channel" the other type
of Energy Manipulation we don't know of?!

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:51.580
Yes. The Energy Manipulation
you and Hosei use

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.300
to transfer energy into your
weapons is "outer-channel."

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:56.800
And the one Taito demonstrated just now

00:12:56.800 --> 00:13:00.480
by channeling energy through
his own body is "inner-channel."

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:05.820
You still need a lot more practice
until you can fully control it, though.

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:10.120
But you'll master it soon enough, as long
as you don't forget how it felt just now.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:12.960
Right. Thanks, Koei!

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:14.960
What the hell?! What the hell?!

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:17.960
Why are you being so soft on Taito?!

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:23.300
There is only one way to describe
your knowledge and insight: superb!

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:25.080
Very well done, Lady Koei!

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:27.280
You're in a league all your own!

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:30.820
Oh, you two! Don't flatter me like that!

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:33.420
I did it! Praise <i>me</i>!

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:36.820
Taito. Promise me this.

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:41.180
Inner-channeling is a double-edged sword;
one wrong step and you'll hurt yourself.

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:43.480
You must always remain
calm, cool, and collected

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:46.920
and never let anger or hate control you.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:51.960
If you can't maintain self-control,
then you aren't fit to use inner-channeling.

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:53.440
Do you understand?

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:55.260
Y-yes!

00:13:55.260 --> 00:14:00.840
Oh, man! You sound so submissive
saying "Yes!" like that! It's weird!

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:03.000
S-shut up! What's wrong with that?!

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.440
Yes. It's disgusting.

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:08.840
Don't say that so calmly!

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:10.540
Why...?

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:16.780
Thank you for the meal!

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:20.960
Whew! I'm stuffed!
You're a great cook too, Koei!

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:22.120
You can say that again.

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:27.360
You're so lucky, Hosei! You got to eat
such delicious food all this time!

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:32.500
Yeah, I guess.
I'm gonna get some fresh air.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:34.500
Hey, Hosei!

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.720
Honestly, now. What is he sulking about?

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:42.340
He's sulking?

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:45.260
I praised Taito earlier,

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:49.520
so he must feel irritated
because I used to be strict with him.

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:52.920
I was only strict because he was still a child.

00:14:52.920 --> 00:14:54.900
If I hadn't taught him discipline,

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:58.160
how would he ever learn about
things like morals and manners?

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:00.060
He's such a fool...

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:01.660
Then he's also...?

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:04.600
Yes. An orphan.

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:09.180
But even simpleminded fools
like him have good sides to them.

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:13.520
I know it might be difficult,
but please continue to lend him your help.

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:16.720
Yeah! You can count on us!

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:20.380
Koei is really charming!

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:26.300
She's a little violent, but she's nice,
warmhearted, and can do anything.

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:32.520
Say, Taito. Do you think
our mothers were like that too?

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:36.400
I did it again...

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:39.240
That's weird. I did it so well before...

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:43.200
Maybe you need Koei to help after all?

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:45.980
It does me no good
if I need help all the time.

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:49.980
If I had had someone like her as a parent,

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:53.620
I might not have been abandoned either...

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:55.380
Taito...

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:56.760
Just kidding!

00:15:56.760 --> 00:16:00.900
If that had been the case, I never
would've met you or Dad or the others!

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:02.300
Good night!

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:11.640
Are you still bent out of shape?

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.920
It's not like that.

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:19.780
You really are dumb.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:22.840
Different people need to be
taught in different ways.

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:26.520
Do you fight everyone the exact same way?

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:32.360
No, but you're being way too blatant!
I think it's just favoritism!

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:37.460
Oh? Is there something for me
to gain by being partial to Taito?

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:43.300
No... but <i>he's</i> the Alkaid
while I'm just the Phecda...

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:45.140
What are you talking about?

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:47.140
It's true that in the Tale of the Big Dipper

00:16:47.140 --> 00:16:49.780
the Alkaid, as one of the
Celestial Deities, is treated better

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:52.820
than the Phecda,
one of the Five Divine Warriors.

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:55.320
But so what?!

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:58.980
I took you in, raised you,
fed you, taught you,

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:02.460
punished you, hit you and kicked you...

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:07.220
The karma of the stars
has nothing to do with that.

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:12.360
If it doesn't, then I guess
that really does make me a loser.

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:14.340
You still think that, Hosei?!

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:19.200
Shut up! Taito isn't better
than me! You dumb hag!

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:21.400
H-hey! Hosei!

00:17:24.220 --> 00:17:28.640
Sheesh... You're still so childish...

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:35.420
What unpleasant stars...

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:38.420
What the hell?! What the hell?!

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:44.260
Damn it!

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:48.100
If she's my master, she can at least
acknowledge me a little more!

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:56.900
Night bandits?

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:59.240
Don't tell me they're headed for us?!

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:04.180
Stop right there, you lousy bandits!

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:08.880
I am Hosei, Koei's best pupil!

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:11.440
I won't let you have
your way on this mountain!

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:16.580
<i>I'm going to make my master</i>...

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:20.220
...<i>acknowledge my skills!</i>

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:30.360
Where are you going at this hour?

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:34.420
To find my fool of a pupil.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:37.320
He hasn't come back
since he rushed off sulking.

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:41.620
Allow me to accompany you.
It's dangerous to travel alone at night.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:45.560
I'll be fine. This mountain
is like my backyard.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:49.900
Besides, we'll probably
wind up lost if you come along.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:51.940
You heard about that as well?

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.500
I'll be back soon.

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:58.580
He'll start sulking again if I don't
find him. He's a difficult boy.

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:01.300
Oh, yes, Ryuko.

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:02.140
Yes?

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:04.740
It's fine to shoulder
nerve-wracking burdens and all,

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:08.420
but sometimes it's also important
to follow the path you believe in.

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:09.620
Lady Koei...

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:13.600
You <i>do</i> have a life of your own.

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:24.860
That's one down! Now who's next?!

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:30.300
What?!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:35.880
Wh-what the hell?! Take this!

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:42.000
How?!

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:46.820
Oh, my!

00:19:46.820 --> 00:19:51.820
I never expected the Phecda
to waltz out here all alone like this!

00:19:54.220 --> 00:19:55.700
Who are you?!

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:57.500
I am Shimei.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:58.740
Shimei?

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:02.960
Interesting! Using <i>you</i> sounds like fun!

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:17.740
Now to show the Alkaid boy
and all his friends hell!

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:24.380
<i>Say, Master</i>.

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:28.890
<i>Do you think I could go to the capital</i>
<i>with Laila and the others?</i>

00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:32.320
<i>You know pupils need</i>
<i>to leave the nest someday</i>.

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:35.060
<i>You still know so little about the world</i>.

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:38.200
<i>You need to learn much more</i>.

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:39.500
<i>Yeah</i>...

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:44.970
<i>Hosei. Take good care</i>
<i>of Taito and the others</i>...

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:50.570
<i>On Hero Tales,</i>
<i>"Chapter Seven: Sorrowful Phecda."</i>

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:05.490
<i>Master</i>... <i>I thank you for</i>... <i>for</i>...
